    "one p8w_step completes at most one simulation slice",
    "p8w_compile is invalid until a nonzero host binding is installed exactly once",
    "synchronous host calls use an 80-byte frame with twelve raw Q16.16 slots, one pointer-length byte string and an int32 result slot",
